      "comment": "The golem turns on its feet instead of rotating in place: step_turn holds the body where its feet point, steps the leg on the side of the turn first and lets the body follow, then the other. It fades in while the golem stands. The upper body reacts: the torso leads the turn, the arms lag behind it and swing out when a foot lands, the head keeps looking where the golem looks.",
